{
  "message": "The question asks for the percentage change in after-tax share-based compensation cost from 2009 to 2010. The table shows share-based compensation cost and income tax benefit. After-tax cost = share-based compensation cost + income tax benefit (since benefit reduces cost). For 2009: 14.6 + (-5.2) = 9.4. For 2010: 18.1 + (-6.3) = 11.8. Percentage change = ((11.8 - 9.4) / 9.4) * 100.",
